    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34471" root="فلج" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِيَالَجَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِلْجَانٌ</span>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَيَالِجَة</span> occurs in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قز</span>
in the TA, as its pl.; being there expl. as meaning <i>small cups</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَنَاجِين</span>) <i>in which wine</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرَاب</span>) <i>is
drunk:</i> but I think that this may be taken from
a mistranscription for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِيَالَجَة</span>.]

